  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Do not touch that—!
  - name: Burnout
    dialog: ...tired...
  - name: Burnout
    dialog: why... keep going...
  - name: Burnout
    dialog: just... rest...
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Founder, listen to me. I know the weight is heavy.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: But we cannot stop. Not now. Not when the shape is finally emerging.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Push through. The vision demands it. And so do I.
